  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the Faction sphere package you do not already have. When you requisition a retainer, you can have the faction equip your retainer in a manner equivalent to an NPC of their level by spending an additional 1 authorization when you request them (see NPCs in Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Core Rulebook or NPC stat blocks in the Pathfinder Roleplaying Game NPC Codex or Pathfinder Roleplaying Game: GameMastery Guide for examples). You also gain the new package’s skill as an additional associated skill for this sphere.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/faction#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
